{"seq":1,"slug":"threshold-multiwindow-burn","title":"阈值、多窗口与错误预算 burn 告警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/metrics-monitoring-alerting-platform/alerting-noise/threshold-multiwindow-burn","wordCount":2269,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"阈值-多窗口与错误预算-burn-告警\">阈值、多窗口与错误预算 burn 告警</h1><h2 id=\"为什么静态阈值必然要么太吵要么太迟\">为什么静态阈值必然要么太吵要么太迟</h2><p>静态阈值告警的根本困境在于它把两个独立的问题压成了一个数字：<strong>现在有多糟</strong>和<strong>持续了多久</strong>。设阈值告警时你只有一个旋钮，往上拧会让告警变迟钝（漏掉正在发生的故障），往下拧会让告警变吵（正常抖动就触发）。这个矛盾无法通过调参解决，只能通过改变告警的判据来解决。</p>\n<p>Google SRE 提出的多窗口多 burn rate 方法换了一个判据：不问&quot;错误率是否超过 X%&quot;，而问&quot;错误预算被消耗的速度是正常速度的几倍&quot;。这个转换的关键在于 burn rate 是一个<strong>归一化</strong>的量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>observed error rate</mtext><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>SLO</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b = \\frac{\\text{observed error rate}}{1 - \\text{SLO}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLO</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">observed error rate</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 SLO 是 99.9% 时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>SLO</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\text{SLO} = 0.001</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.001</span></span></span></span></span>，即 0.1% 是&quot;刚好按计划耗尽预算&quot;的速度。burn rate 为 1 表示预算正好按时用光；1 表示 14.4 倍速消耗意味着按这个速度，预算会在 SLO 窗口的 1/14.4 时间内耗尽<a href=\"https://sre.google/workbook/alerting-on-slos/\">sre.google/workbook/alerting-on-slos</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  E[错误率 e] --&gt; B[&quot;burn rate b = e / (1 - SLO)&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; W1[&quot;长窗口 W_L&lt;br/&gt;确认已消耗有意义预算&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; W2[&quot;短窗口 W_S&lt;br/&gt;确认问题仍在进行&quot;]&#10;  W1 --&gt; AND{两个窗口都超阈值?}&#10;  W2 --&gt; AND&#10;  AND --&gt;|是| FIRE[触发告警]&#10;  AND --&gt;|否| WAIT[保持静默]&#10;  FIRE --&gt; SEV{severity}&#10;  SEV --&gt;|高 burn| PAGE[PagerDuty 立即呼叫]&#10;  SEV --&gt;|低 burn| TICKET[工单]\">graph TD\n  E[错误率 e] --&gt; B[\"burn rate b = e / (1 - SLO)\"]\n  B --&gt; W1[\"长窗口 W_L&lt;br/&gt;确认已消耗有意义预算\"]\n  B --&gt; W2[\"短窗口 W_S&lt;br/&gt;确认问题仍在进行\"]\n  W1 --&gt; AND{两个窗口都超阈值?}\n  W2 --&gt; AND\n  AND --&gt;|是| FIRE[触发告警]\n  AND --&gt;|否| WAIT[保持静默]\n  FIRE --&gt; SEV{severity}\n  SEV --&gt;|高 burn| PAGE[PagerDuty 立即呼叫]\n  SEV --&gt;|低 burn| TICKET[工单]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>**burn rate（预算消耗速率）**是观测错误率相对&quot;刚好按计划耗尽预算&quot;速度的倍数：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>SLO</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b = e / (1-\\text{SLO})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLO</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。它是归一化量——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示预算正好按时用光，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>14.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b=14.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14.4</span></span></span></span></span> 表示按此速度会在 SLO 窗口的 1/14.4 时间内烧完。</p>\n<p><strong>多窗口判据</strong>指每个告警档位要求<strong>长窗口与短窗口同时超阈值</strong>：长窗口确认&quot;已消耗有意义的预算&quot;，短窗口确认&quot;问题仍在进行&quot;。它替代静态阈值的理由在于静态阈值把&quot;现在有多糟&quot;与&quot;持续了多久&quot;压成了一个旋钮。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双窗口判据与它解决的问题\">双窗口判据与它解决的问题</h2><p>多 burn rate 的核心设计是<strong>每个告警带要求两个窗口同时超阈值</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>error rate</mtext><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>SLO</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>AND</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mtext>error rate</mtext><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>S</mi></msub></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>SLO</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{error rate}_{W_L} &gt; B(1-\\text{SLO}) \\quad \\text{AND} \\quad \\text{error rate}_{W_S} &gt; B(1-\\text{SLO})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8654em;vertical-align:-0.2503em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">error rate</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2503em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0003em;vertical-align:-0.2503em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLO</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AND</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">error rate</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3567em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1433em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2503em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLO</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>长窗口的作用是确认&quot;已经消耗了有意义的预算&quot;——它避免了因一次瞬时抖动而呼叫。短窗口的作用是确认&quot;问题仍然在发生&quot;——它让已经恢复的故障能<strong>快速解除告警</strong>。只用长窗口会导致故障恢复后告警仍要挂很久（长窗口的滞后）；只用短窗口则会被瞬时尖峰反复触发。</p>\n<h3 id=\"两个窗口的推荐比例\">两个窗口的推荐比例</h3><p>Google SRE workbook 给出的经验比例是：<strong>短窗口取长窗口时长的 1/12</strong>。这不是精确的科学常数，而是一个在&quot;确认仍在进行&quot;与&quot;给自己留出解除时间&quot;之间取得平衡的经验值。配得太短（如 1/60）会让短窗口容易被噪声淹没；配得太长（如 1/2）则长窗口的意义被削弱。</p>\n<h3 id=\"触发时间与预算消耗的推导\">触发时间与预算消耗的推导</h3><p>对恒定错误比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 的持续故障，告警触发所需时间为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>fire</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>SLO</mtext></mrow><mi>e</mi></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{fire}} = \\frac{1 - \\text{SLO}}{e} \\times W_L \\times B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fire</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLO</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>而到触发时刻为止消耗掉的预算占比是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>budget fraction</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><mtext>SLO period</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{budget fraction} = \\frac{B \\times W_L}{\\text{SLO period}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">budget fraction</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLO period</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第二个公式很有用，因为它让你可以<strong>反向设计</strong>：先决定&quot;这个级别的告警最多允许消耗多少预算&quot;，再反解出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的组合。这也解释了为什么不同级别的告警能有不同的预算消耗目标——它们在用不同的&quot;容忍度&quot;换取不同的响应速度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"官方推荐参数组\">官方推荐参数组</h2><p>对 30 天窗口的 99.9% SLO，workbook 的表 5-8 给出了一组可直接采用起点参数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>长窗口</th>\n<th>短窗口</th>\n<th>burn rate</th>\n<th>预算消耗</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Page</td>\n<td>1 小时</td>\n<td>5 分钟</td>\n<td>14.4×</td>\n<td>2%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Page</td>\n<td>6 小时</td>\n<td>30 分钟</td>\n<td>6×</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ticket</td>\n<td>3 天</td>\n<td>6 小时</td>\n<td>1×</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>workbook 的示例表达式里还包含一条额外的工单档：<strong>24 小时 / 2 小时、burn rate 3×</strong>，同样对应 10% 的预算消耗。写成布尔逻辑就是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Page</strong>：(1h 且 5m 超过 14.4×) 或 (6h 且 30m 超过 6×)</li>\n<li><strong>Ticket</strong>：(24h 且 2h 超过 3×) 或 (3d 且 6h 超过 1×)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套参数的设计意图是让告警的紧急程度与&quot;多快会烧完预算&quot;成正比：14.4× 意味着两天左右就会烧光一个月的预算，值得半夜叫人；1× 意味着按当前速度月底刚好用光，开个工单就够了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-sli-到告警规则的落地\">从 SLI 到告警规则的落地</h2><p>把上面的公式落到 PromQL 时，推荐先定义<strong>错误预算消耗率</strong>这个中间序列，再让各级别告警共用它。这样做的价值是让告警规则变得可读，并且当你调整 SLO 目标时只需要改一处。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"groups:&#10;  - name: slo-burn&#10;    interval: 30s&#10;    rules:&#10;      # 中间序列：错误预算消耗率（burn rate），按 service 维度&#10;      - record: service:error_budget_burn_rate:1h&#10;        expr: |&#10;          (&#10;            sum by (service) (rate(http_requests_total{code=~&quot;5..&quot;}[1h]))&#10;              /&#10;            sum by (service) (rate(http_requests_total[1h]))&#10;          ) / (1 - 0.999)&#10;      - record: service:error_budget_burn_rate:5m&#10;        expr: |&#10;          (&#10;            sum by (service) (rate(http_requests_total{code=~&quot;5..&quot;}[5m]))&#10;              /&#10;            sum by (service) (rate(http_requests_total[5m]))&#10;          ) / (1 - 0.999)&#10;&#10;  - name: slo-alerts&#10;    rules:&#10;      - alert: ErrorBudgetBurnFast&#10;        expr: |&#10;          service:error_budget_burn_rate:1h{severity_hint=&quot;page&quot;} &gt; 14.4&#10;            and&#10;          service:error_budget_burn_rate:5m &gt; 14.4&#10;        for: 2m&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: page&#10;        annotations:&#10;          summary: &#39;{{ $labels.service }} 预算消耗 {{ $value | printf &quot;%.1f&quot; }}× （14.4× 档）&#39;&#10;          runbook_url: &#39;https://runbooks.internal/slo-burn-fast&#39;&#10;&#10;      - alert: ErrorBudgetBurnSlow&#10;        expr: |&#10;          service:error_budget_burn_rate:6h &gt; 6&#10;            and&#10;          service:error_budget_burn_rate:30m &gt; 6&#10;        for: 15m&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: page\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">slo-burn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 中间序列：错误预算消耗率（burn rate），按 service 维度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">service:error_budget_burn_rate:1h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            sum by (service) (rate(http_requests_total{code=~\"5..\"}[1h]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">              /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            sum by (service) (rate(http_requests_total[1h]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          ) / (1 - 0.999)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">service:error_budget_burn_rate:5m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            sum by (service) (rate(http_requests_total{code=~\"5..\"}[5m]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">              /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            sum by (service) (rate(http_requests_total[5m]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          ) / (1 - 0.999)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">slo-alerts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ErrorBudgetBurnFast</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          service:error_budget_burn_rate:1h{severity_hint=\"page\"} > 14.4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            and</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          service:error_budget_burn_rate:5m > 14.4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">page</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          summary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{{ $labels.service }} 预算消耗 {{ $value | printf \"%.1f\" }}× （14.4× 档）'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          runbook_url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://runbooks.internal/slo-burn-fast'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ErrorBudgetBurnSlow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          service:error_budget_burn_rate:6h > 6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            and</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          service:error_budget_burn_rate:30m > 6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">15m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">page</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"for-子句与双窗口的关系\">for 子句与双窗口的关系</h3><p><code>for</code> 是 Prometheus 告警规则的可选等待期，在条件首次满足后，告警进入 <code>pending</code> 状态，持续满足该时长后才转为 <code>firing</code>；不写 <code>for</code> 则规则&quot;在第一次求值时即变为活跃&quot;<a href=\"https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/alerting_rules/\">prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/alerting_rules</a>。<code>for</code> 与短窗口的作用局部重叠但<strong>不可互相替代</strong>：短窗口是判据的一部分（窗口内的平均错误率），<code>for</code> 是状态机的时间要求（连续 N 次求值都满足）。</p>\n<p>实践中 <code>for</code> 应当设得<strong>明显小于</strong>短窗口。短窗口 5 分钟配 <code>for: 10m</code> 是矛盾配置——<code>for</code> 的等待时间比判据窗口还长，意味着告警的响应速度被 <code>for</code> 拖住而不是由判据决定。常见做法是 <code>for</code> 取 1–2 个求值周期，仅用于滤掉单次求值的边界抖动。</p>\n<h3 id=\"低流量服务的修正\">低流量服务的修正</h3><p>流量极低时（例如错误率的分母每分钟只有个位数），任何一次错误都会让比例跳到 100%，burn rate 直接爆表。这不是告警配置的问题而是统计功效的问题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"判据从比例改为绝对量\">判据从比例改为绝对量</h4><p>第一种修正是把 SLI 从&quot;错误率&quot;改成&quot;错误计数&quot;这类绝对量判据。绝对量的好处是它天然带有样本量的意义：一次错误就是一个单位的预算消耗，不需要分母来放大它。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"promql\" data-code=\"# 低流量服务的绝对量判据：按预算额度而非比例判断&#10;#   30 天 99.9% SLO 下，允许的失败请求数 = 总请求数 * 0.001&#10;- record: service:error_budget_consumed_requests:1h&#10;  expr: sum by (service) (increase(http_requests_total{code=~&quot;5..&quot;}[1h]))&#10;&#10;- alert: ErrorBudgetConsumedFastLowTraffic&#10;  expr: |&#10;    service:error_budget_consumed_requests:1h&#10;      &gt; 0.25 * (1 - 0.999) * (24 * 30 / 24)   # 一天额度用掉了 25%&#10;  for: 10m&#10;  labels:&#10;    severity: ticket&#10;  annotations:&#10;    summary: &quot;{{ $labels.service }} 昨日预算额度已消耗 25% 以上&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 低流量服务的绝对量判据：按预算额度而非比例判断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#   30 天 99.9% SLO 下，允许的失败请求数 = 总请求数 * 0.001</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- record: service:error_budget_consumed_requests:1h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  expr: sum by (service) (increase(http_requests_total{code=~\"5..\"}[1h]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- alert: ErrorBudgetConsumedFastLowTraffic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  expr: |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    service:error_budget_consumed_requests:1h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      > 0.25 * (1 - 0.999) * (24 * 30 / 24)   # 一天额度用掉了 25%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for: 10m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  labels:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    severity: ticket</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  annotations:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    summary: \"{{ $labels.service }} 昨日预算额度已消耗 25% 以上\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"窗口与级别的选择\">窗口与级别的选择</h4><p>另外两种缓解方式是：把窗口拉长到足以累积有意义的分母；或者对低流量服务单独使用工单级别，不配 page 级告警。第三种做法最诚实——一个每天只有几十次请求的服务，本来就无法用 99.9% 的可用性目标做统计意义上的判断。把它的目标从可用性比例改成&quot;每月失败请求总数不超过 N&quot;，既保留约束力，又让判据在低样本量下依然稳定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与告警降噪机制的衔接\">与告警降噪机制的衔接</h2><p>多窗口 burn 告警已经把&quot;重复触发&quot;和&quot;瞬时抖动&quot;大幅压下去了，但它仍然会产出<strong>多个相关告警同时触发</strong>的场面：一个核心依赖故障会让所有依赖它的服务同时烧预算。这类&quot;同一根因、多个症状&quot;的重复必须在下游处理，见 <a href=\"group-inhibit-silence\">告警分组、抑制与静默</a>——分组让它们合并成一条通知，抑制让下游症状在上游根因已告警时被静默。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缺口感</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>本章对策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>判据太粗</td>\n<td>同一阈值在忙时太吵、闲时太迟</td>\n<td>双窗口 burn rate，按级别分档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>判据被抖动重置</td>\n<td>告警反复预备但从不触发</td>\n<td>用 <code>rate</code> 而非 <code>irate</code> 做判据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指标消失即静默</td>\n<td>服务挂掉比变慢更安静</td>\n<td>补 <code>absent()</code> / <code>up == 0</code> 告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>根因未建模</td>\n<td>只看到下游症状，排查从零开始</td>\n<td>补因果层指标，用抑制压症状</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通知无行动信息</td>\n<td>收到后仍要问&quot;该做什么&quot;</td>\n<td>用 <code>$value</code> + <code>runbook_url</code> 补齐要素</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>absent()</code> 是其中必须显式补上的一条：当指标本身消失时，所有基于 <code>&gt;阈值</code> 的表达式都会变空而不触发，于是&quot;服务挂了&quot;反而比&quot;服务很慢&quot;更安静。拉取场景下 <code>up == 0</code> 覆盖了目标不可达，但指标名被改名、Exporter 崩溃、推送链路中断这些情况仍然需要一条独立的&quot;系列缺失&quot;告警。配置好之后必须用合成告警验证它真的会触发，理由与 <a href=\"alert-routing-priority\">告警路由与优先级</a> 中路由演练相同：这类规则可能几个月都不会被真实故障触发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>静态阈值把&quot;多糟&quot;和&quot;多久&quot;压成一个旋钮，必然在噪声与迟钝之间二选一。</li>\n<li>burn rate <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>SLO</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b = e / (1-\\text{SLO})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLO</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 做归一化；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示按计划耗尽预算。</li>\n<li>多窗口判据要求长窗口与短窗口<strong>同时</strong>超阈值；短窗口约为长窗口的 1/12。</li>\n<li>30 天 99.9% SLO 的起点参数：Page 14.4×(1h/5m, 2%) 与 6×(6h/30m, 5%)；Ticket 1×(3d/6h, 10%)。</li>\n<li><code>for</code> 应明显小于短窗口；两者作用不同，不可互相替代。</li>\n<li>低流量服务需要拉长窗口或改用绝对量判据，而不是硬套比例告警。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"阈值、多窗口与错误预算 burn 告警","id":"阈值-多窗口与错误预算-burn-告警"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么静态阈值必然要么太吵要么太迟","id":"为什么静态阈值必然要么太吵要么太迟"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"双窗口判据与它解决的问题","id":"双窗口判据与它解决的问题"},{"level":3,"text":"两个窗口的推荐比例","id":"两个窗口的推荐比例"},{"level":3,"text":"触发时间与预算消耗的推导","id":"触发时间与预算消耗的推导"},{"level":2,"text":"官方推荐参数组","id":"官方推荐参数组"},{"level":2,"text":"从 SLI 到告警规则的落地","id":"从-sli-到告警规则的落地"},{"level":3,"text":"for 子句与双窗口的关系","id":"for-子句与双窗口的关系"},{"level":3,"text":"低流量服务的修正","id":"低流量服务的修正"},{"level":4,"text":"判据从比例改为绝对量","id":"判据从比例改为绝对量"},{"level":4,"text":"窗口与级别的选择","id":"窗口与级别的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"与告警降噪机制的衔接","id":"与告警降噪机制的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"直方图与分位数聚合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/metrics-monitoring-alerting-platform/timeseries-storage-query/histogram-percentile-agg"},"next":{"title":"分组、抑制与静默","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/metrics-monitoring-alerting-platform/alerting-noise/group-inhibit-silence"}}